  data: {
    LLM: 'Players draw and discard, melding sequences of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit. Wild cards (jokers/twos) can substitute. First player to empty hand takes a morto (11-card extra hand). Team can go out after taking morto and having at least one canastra. Play ends when team goes out or cards exhausted.',
    Player: 'Players draw and discard, melding sequences of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit. Wild cards (jokers/twos) can substitute. First player to empty hand takes a morto (11-card extra hand). Team can go out after taking morto and having at least one canastra. Play ends when team goes out or cards exhausted.',
    objective: 'Be the first team to reach target score (typically 2000-3000 points) by melding sequences, creating canastas (7+ card sequences), and going out. Score points from melded cards plus bonuses.',
    gameplay: 'Players draw and discard, melding sequences of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit. Wild cards (jokers/twos) can substitute. First player to empty hand takes a morto (11-card extra hand). Team can go out after taking morto and having at least one canastra. Play ends when team goes out or cards exhausted.',
    keyRules: [
      'Two 11-card mortos set aside for first players out',
      'Melds are sequences of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit',
      'Canastra = sequence of 7+ cards',
      'Clean canastra (no wilds) scores more than dirty',
      'Must have taken morto and have canastra to go out',
      'Target typically 2000-3000 points',
      'Vulnerability rule: half target score needs minimum opening meld',
    ],
