    turnFlow: 'Players draw and discard, melding sequences of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit. Wild cards (jokers/twos) can substitute. First player to empty hand takes a morto (11-card extra hand). Team can go out after taking morto and having at least one canastra. Play ends when team goes out or cards exhausted.',
